<title>BELGIUM: INSIGHT - Chartists bullish on Bel-20 share index.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Chartists bullish on Bel-20 share index.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>All things being equal, the Bel-20 share index  .BFX should continue to rise, Belgian analysts said on Tuesday, but a weaker dollar made the technical picture murky and could brake any move.</p>
<p>Resistance around 1,830 points, just below the all-time high at 1,831.98, was seen the key to further gains.</p>
<p>Last Friday the Bel-20 closed at 1,823.69.</p>
